WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.240
And today I'm going to show you my hobbies.

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:08.380
So guys, the word hobby and the word pastime, they mean the same thing.

00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:11.840
They are things that you like to do when you are not busy, when

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:14.340
you are not working, when you are not studying.

00:00:14.340 --> 00:00:19.020
The things you like to do with your free time for fun.

00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:23.140
Okay. So you can see I have my guitar with me.

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:28.940
Now guys, this is a hobby that I have had on and off for

00:00:28.940 --> 00:00:31.480
probably 18 years.

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:33.400
No, maybe longer, maybe 20 years.

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:38.880
I have been playing guitar on and off now.

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:45.360
The phrase on and off means that I have not been playing guitar for

00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:51.220
20 years. No, it means I played for a year, then I stopped for

00:00:51.220 --> 00:00:56.260
2 years, then I played for 2 years, then I stopped for 5 years,

00:00:56.260 --> 00:00:57.860
on and off.

00:00:57.860 --> 00:01:04.680
Okay? And because I've done it on and off, I'm not that good, guys.

00:01:04.680 --> 00:01:05.820
I'm really not that good.

00:01:05.820 --> 00:01:08.700
But it is a cool hobby.

00:01:08.700 --> 00:01:12.080
I do enjoy making music, and I think it's fun.

00:01:12.080 --> 00:01:16.000
So, I'm going to play a little piece of a song, and I want

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:20.320
you guys to tell me if you know which band this is, which famous

00:01:20.320 --> 00:01:22.480
rock band from a long time ago.

00:01:22.480 --> 00:01:26.640
Not very good, but I do like to play guitar.

00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:32.752
So guys, one interesting thing, interesting piece of vocabulary about instruments.

00:01:33.292 --> 00:01:36.712
An instrument is anything that you use to make music.

00:01:36.712 --> 00:01:40.532
Guitars, pianos, drums, those are instruments.

00:01:40.532 --> 00:01:47.292
Okay? Now in English, if somebody uses an instrument to make music, we do

00:01:47.292 --> 00:01:52.652
not say "I do the guitar", "I use the guitar".

00:01:53.072 --> 00:01:56.252
In Spanish they use the verb "to touch", tocar.

00:01:56.452 --> 00:01:57.752
"I touch the guitar."

00:01:57.752 --> 00:02:00.272
No, in English we say play.

00:02:00.272 --> 00:02:02.092
I play the guitar.

00:02:02.812 --> 00:02:04.052
Play the guitar.

00:02:05.952 --> 00:02:07.172
Play the guitar.

00:02:07.172 --> 00:02:10.252
Okay. Just an interesting piece of vocabulary.

00:02:10.292 --> 00:02:13.072
So tell me guys, do you play any instruments?

00:02:13.072 --> 00:02:17.792
Okay. The next hobby is one that I am very passionate about.

00:02:18.272 --> 00:02:21.512
Okay. And that is learning languages.

00:02:22.392 --> 00:02:28.792
Guys, learning languages has absolutely changed my life in so many ways.

00:02:28.792 --> 00:02:35.052
And guys, because I chose to learn Spanish four, 5 years ago, so many

00:02:35.052 --> 00:02:37.372
great things have came into my life.

00:02:37.372 --> 00:02:42.632
Okay? I met a beautiful Colombian woman and I was able to speak with

00:02:42.632 --> 00:02:45.712
her because I spoke and understood Spanish.

00:02:45.712 --> 00:02:47.652
She became my wife, guys.

00:02:47.652 --> 00:02:50.092
Without Spanish, I would have never met my wife.

00:02:50.092 --> 00:02:55.152
If I didn't learn Spanish and realize how fulfilling it is to learn a

00:02:55.152 --> 00:02:59.743
language, how much I enjoy it, I would have never started this channel and

00:02:59.743 --> 00:03:04.783
I would have missed the opportunity that I've had to meet and speak with

00:03:04.783 --> 00:03:09.023
so many incredible people from all around the world.

00:03:09.023 --> 00:03:15.063
So guys, the hobby of language learning has been a key in my life.

00:03:15.063 --> 00:03:17.823
It has been something that makes me happy.

00:03:17.823 --> 00:03:21.103
It has been something that has brought me a lot of success and it

00:03:21.103 --> 00:03:24.363
is something that I want to share with you guys.

00:03:24.363 --> 00:03:25.203
All right, guys.

00:03:25.203 --> 00:03:28.923
So, another thing that I spend a lot of my free time on, another

00:03:28.923 --> 00:03:33.763
hobby of mine or another pastime is reading good books.

00:03:33.763 --> 00:03:38.203
Now, I love to read because I always love to keep on learning, growing

00:03:38.203 --> 00:03:39.963
my view of the world.

00:03:40.683 --> 00:03:43.883
And I think that reading is one of the best things that you can

00:03:43.883 --> 00:03:48.923
do for your brain, for your mental health, for your life in general.

00:03:48.923 --> 00:03:50.963
Successful people read, guys.

00:03:50.963 --> 00:03:55.883
So I usually do not read books that are fiction.

00:03:55.883 --> 00:03:57.203
I like non-fiction.

00:03:57.203 --> 00:04:03.343
So the difference between fiction and non-fiction, a fiction book is a story.

00:04:03.343 --> 00:04:07.283
Okay? It's a story like Star Wars or Lord of the Rings.

00:04:07.283 --> 00:04:08.703
It's fantasy. Okay?

00:04:08.703 --> 00:04:09.523
It's not real.

00:04:09.523 --> 00:04:14.563
Non-fiction will be something about history or about a great person.

00:04:14.563 --> 00:04:17.823
And I prefer to read books that I can learn something from.

00:04:17.983 --> 00:04:24.143
So, another hobby that I don't actually do right now, but I spent years

00:04:24.143 --> 00:04:29.295
doing. I loved it, but there's a couple of reasons why I stopped, and

00:04:29.295 --> 00:04:31.835
I'll explain those in just a minute.

00:04:31.835 --> 00:04:38.475
Martial arts. Martial arts, but not like that.

00:04:38.475 --> 00:04:40.295
Not karate or kung fu.

00:04:40.295 --> 00:04:42.155
I'm just trying to be funny, guys.

00:04:42.155 --> 00:04:46.815
I probably spent 4 years training martial arts a couple of days a week

00:04:46.815 --> 00:04:51.235
consistently and I absolutely loved it.

00:04:51.235 --> 00:04:54.575
I loved it because it makes your body in really good shape, you get

00:04:54.575 --> 00:05:00.355
stronger and it gives you a confidence, makes you confident that if something happens,

00:05:00.355 --> 00:05:02.755
you know how to protect yourself.

00:05:02.755 --> 00:05:04.115
Why did I stop?

00:05:04.115 --> 00:05:06.095
Well, guys, several reasons.

00:05:06.095 --> 00:05:07.995
One, it's expensive.

00:05:08.295 --> 00:05:11.955
It cost a lot of money, guys, to be a member of a

00:05:11.955 --> 00:05:13.055
martial arts gym.

00:05:13.055 --> 00:05:19.435
And I was thinking to myself that I'm never going to be a professional

00:05:19.435 --> 00:05:21.395
fighter. I don't want to be.

00:05:21.395 --> 00:05:23.095
I don't want to hurt people.

00:05:23.095 --> 00:05:26.535
I just want to know how to protect myself and my family.

00:05:26.715 --> 00:05:31.135
So why am I spending so much money, thousands of dollars a year to

00:05:31.135 --> 00:05:33.915
do something that will never give me any money back?

00:05:33.915 --> 00:05:38.435
So, one part of it was I decided that I wanted to stop giving

00:05:38.435 --> 00:05:43.935
my time and money to that and put my time and money into things

00:05:44.375 --> 00:05:49.175
that can pay me back that one day can be an investment and I

00:05:49.175 --> 00:05:50.495
can make some money with.

00:05:50.495 --> 00:05:53.395
So, I decided that I was going to start using my time and money

00:05:53.395 --> 00:05:58.895
to improve my channel and learn as many different things as I possibly could.
